One of the most annoying things in nethack is that it is hard to identify
things.  I think that a good addition to the game would be to allow shop-
keepers to identify things that you have, for a price of course.  A general
shopkeeper should be able to identify anything for you (not that anythign
in the shop is identified, because it won't be).  A wand shopkeeper can
only identify wands, a potion shopkeeper can only identify potions, etc.
The cost to identify should be constant for any item within the same item
class, i.e. weapons cost x to identify, potions y, books z, etc. regardless
of enchantment, blessed, cursed, etc.

Does anyone find a problem with this?  I would like to see it added.
